docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:7:This plan describes how to turn collected testimony, documents, web evidence, and authority references into a causal and temporal timeline suitable for temporal deontic first-order logic and DCEC style theorem proving.
docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:27:- [complaint_phases/intake_case_file.py](../complaint_phases/intake_case_file.py) already builds normalized temporal context and exposes `timeline_relation_summary` plus `timeline_consistency_summary`.
docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:28:- [mediator/claim_support_hooks.py](../mediator/claim_support_hooks.py) already derives element-scoped temporal reasoning context, emits temporal predicates, and now summarizes temporal fact, relation, issue, and warning counts.
docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:29:- [claim_support_review.py](../claim_support_review.py) already propagates claim-level temporal review summaries and flagged element temporal diagnostics.
docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:30:- [mediator/mediator.py](../mediator/mediator.py) already includes timeline relation and consistency summaries in intake status payloads and propagates packet-level temporal readiness counts.
docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:31:- [templates/claim_support_review.html](../templates/claim_support_review.html) already exposes timeline ordering, hybrid reasoning diagnostics, temporal proof handoff, and packet-level temporal readiness chips to operators.
docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:33:That means the plan should not restart from zero. The next work should formalize the timeline model, unify evidence-to-event normalization, and turn temporal diagnostics into proof-ready legal reasoning.
docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:39:1. Normalize each collected evidence item into one or more temporal facts with provenance.
docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:40:2. Infer or capture temporal relations between facts without forcing a fake total order.
docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:42:4. Attach each temporal fact to claim elements, legal predicates, and possible defenses.
docs/TEMPORAL_TIMELINE_PROOF_PLAN.md:44:6. Run proof, contradiction, and temporal consistency checks against the governing law.
